          "body": {
            "en": "Protect Us 4 is the only version able to get AP Divine it also goes +0 and even potentially +1, so its not a bad idea\nThe more Blessing you have (More OUAT), the higher likely Protect Us draws extra\nRatio of OUAT or PU is up to you and your use case"
